<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The copy `:glimmer-catalog` draws, and the source `values-*/strings.xml` translate.

  AGENTS.md: user-visible language copy is a string resource, never a literal. GlimmerTranslationsTest
  fails the build for a key missing from a locale, left as the English copy, or declared and never
  rendered. See GlimmerCopy.kt for why this module uses Android resources where :catalog uses
  compose-resources. #358.
-->
